{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-season-care#feature-feature-seasonal-plan","repo":"uckkk/dsh-season-care","commit":"690457c550fc57ef7326a51a952fb6b7c6f0e345","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-season-care 的功能「季节护肤方案」：调用工具时传入春季、夏季、秋季、冬季或换季，工具返回该季节的护理重点、建议步骤和提示；不传季节或传入未识别值时返回冬季方案。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:8-10","lib/index.js:12-22"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-season-care#feature-feature-season-focus","repo":"uckkk/dsh-season-care","commit":"690457c550fc57ef7326a51a952fb6b7c6f0e345","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-season-care 的功能「不同季节的护理重点」：工具按季节提供不同侧重点：春季抗敏与防晒、夏季防晒与控油、秋季修复与补水、冬季滋润与屏障护理，换季则建议精简并维稳。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-20"]}
{"unit_id":"uckkk__dsh-season-care#feature-feature-routine-tips","repo":"uckkk/dsh-season-care","commit":"690457c550fc57ef7326a51a952fb6b7c6f0e345","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-season-care 的功能「护肤步骤与提示」：每个季节方案包含按顺序排列的护肤步骤和一条针对该季节的提示，供用户快速参考；结果还附有概括全年季节护理重点的说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:14-22"]}
